<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia seeks soft wheat in four lots -local trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks soft wheat in four lots -local trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia on Tuesday launched a tender for the purchase of four lots or more of 25,000 tonnes of soft wheat each for January-February shipments, traders said.</p>
<p>The tender will be awarded on December 5.</p>
<p>Shipment dates are January 1997 1-10, January 15-25, February 1-10, February 15-25.</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
